      "statement": "Revenue Procedure 2025-41 preserves specified-private-activity-bond interest as a section 57(a)(5)(A) tax-preference item included in AMTI and does not modify its definition; FI-US-MUNI-CREDIT 2025-06 identifies the phase-out threshold, rather than that treatment, as the exposure for its historical after-tax thesis.",
